      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Core Provider**\n\nI'm focusing on creating `select_platform_resource.py`, to resolve a resource before calling an external provider. My current approach involves selecting a concrete external provider and building its identification directly into the code. I am exploring potential approaches for how to identify this provider.\n\n\n**Identifying Vertex AI Model**\n\nI've decided to use Vertex AI for this exploration. My next step is creating `select_platform_resource.py` and implementing code to identify a specific model for text generation using the `google.cloud.aiplatform` library. I'll include comments to clarify the provider identification process within the code.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789863185239,
          "start": 1789863182920
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc28c248001wNNj9Q8YeD4mer",
